 again.\nWe would like you to put the former young man you drew last time in the baton twirling club.\nAs you can see in the reference image, he is marching through the city, and we would like you to draw a scene in which he is very embarrassed.\nWe would like to see her legs, etc., so it would be great if she were wearing a mini-skirt like the one shown in the figure, with her legs raised and even her underskirt visible.\nThis is another maniacal request, but we would appreciate it very much.\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/ti1asuU.jpg", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@utatane0_q/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1189318, "client_id": 1905195, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f3ed61f9/uploads/origins/65248033-8fac-475b-8612-97273101068c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d651d34632d7fa02eee3e4de0488dda4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f3ed61f9/uploads/origins/65248033-8fac-475b-8612-97273101068c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d651d34632d7fa02eee3e4de0488dda4, https://si.imgix.net/f3ed61f9/uploads/origins/65248033-8fac-475b-8612-97273101068c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6df0c7bc553f05de1d5fc4eb06f77fa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f3ed61f9/uploads/origins/65248033-8fac-475b-8612-97273101068c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64d66690f2a35e6131bd35046d7de6de 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f3ed61f9/uploads/origins/65248033-8fac-475b-8612-97273101068c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c43ef43c3812328e1d72fd6cd8c115f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f3ed61f9/uploads/origins/65248033-8fac